---

This repository is distributed under a dual-licensing framework modeled after the
open-core standard used by industry-leading infrastructure platforms (e.g., Sentry, Elastic).

The repository is divided into two distinct legal zones:

1. **ZONE 1: Core Protocol Engine & Client SDK** — Licensed under the **MIT License**.
   Includes:
   - `lib/crypto.js` (Proof-of-work generator, HMAC seals, canonicalization)
   - `lib/core.js` (Core verification engine, rate limiting, replay defense)
   - `lib/telemetry.js` (Kinematic jerk entropy & pointer dynamics evaluation)
   - `src/tracer.js` (Client-side attestation collector)
   - `public/obsx.min.js`, `public/veritas.min.js`, `public/tracer.min.js`
   - `tests/` (Protocol compliance and verification test suites)

2. **ZONE 2: Node Operator Scaffolding, Accounts & Dashboard** — Licensed under the **Elastic License 2.0 (ELv2)**.
   Includes:
   - `public/dashboard.html` & `public/dashboard.js` (Node operator management interface)
   - `lib/accounts.js` (Multi-tenant user and project key administration)
   - `lib/mailer.js` (Automated security incident notifications and email delivery)
   - `server.js` (Operator HTTP server harness & metrics telemetry broadcaster)

